# 统一换行：仓库内存 LF，检出时按平台自动转换，避免 Windows 上产生大量
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 噪声与无意义的整文件 diff。
* text=auto

# ---- 明确按二进制处理的文件（绝不做换行转换）----
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.jar  binary
*.aar  binary
*.so   binary
*.a    binary
*.dex  binary
*.apk  binary
*.zip  binary

# ---- 文本文件统一 LF（脚本尤其重要）----
*.java   text
*.kt     text
*.kts    text
*.gradle text
*.pro    text
*.xml    text
*.html   text
*.md     text
*.txt    text
*.json   text
*.sh     text eol=lf
gradlew  text eol=lf
